---
import {
  oneDimensionalPlaneWaveCount,
  planeWaveSeriesValue,
} from '../../../data/part04/ch12TeachingModels.mjs';

const defaultCutoff = 3;
const points = Array.from({ length: 181 }, (_, index) => {
  const x = 2 * Math.PI * index / 180;
  const value = planeWaveSeriesValue(x, defaultCutoff);
  const px = 45 + 510 * index / 180;
  const py = 130 - 68 * value;
  return `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${px.toFixed(2)} ${py.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual pw-cutoff" data-pw-cutoff>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：Fourier 截断如何改变周期函数表示</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: how Fourier truncation changes a periodic representation</span>
  </figcaption>

  <label class="pw-cutoff__control">
    <span>最大谐波 N | Maximum harmonic N</span>
    <input aria-label="Maximum Fourier harmonic" type="range" min="0" max="10" step="1" value={defaultCutoff} data-pw-order />
    <output data-pw-order-output>{defaultCutoff}</output>
  </label>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="pw-cutoff-title pw-cutoff-desc">
    <title id="pw-cutoff-title">Truncated periodic Fourier series</title>
    <desc id="pw-cutoff-desc">A smooth periodic function built from a constant plus cosine harmonics. The retained harmonic order is adjustable.</desc>
    <line x1="45" y1="210" x2="555" y2="210" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="45" y1="30" x2="45" y2="210" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="45" y1="130" x2="555" y2="130" class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={points} class="plot-curve" data-pw-path />
    <text x="45" y="235">0</text>
    <text x="300" y="235" text-anchor="middle">π</text>
    <text x="555" y="235" text-anchor="end">2π</text>
    <text x="18" y="40">f(x)</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>一维基函数数目 | 1D basis count:</span>
    <strong data-pw-count>{oneDimensionalPlaneWaveCount(defaultCutoff)}</strong>
    <span>保留波矢 | retained wave vectors:</span>
    <strong data-pw-range>−{defaultCutoff} … +{defaultCutoff}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>f_N(x)=1/2+Σ[n=1..N] cos(nx)/(1+n²)</code>，周期为 <code>2π</code>；<code>N</code> 是无量纲 Fourier 截断。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>f_N(x)=1/2+Σ[n=1..N] cos(nx)/(1+n²)</code> with period <code>2π</code>; <code>N</code> is a dimensionless Fourier cutoff.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>N=0</code> 时只剩常数 <code>1/2</code>；一维复平面波计数为 <code>2N+1</code>，随 <code>N</code> 严格增加。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> at <code>N=0</code> only the constant <code>1/2</code> remains; the one-dimensional complex plane-wave count is <code>2N+1</code> and increases strictly with <code>N</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>系数是人为选择的平滑教学序列。图形不代表具体赝势、波函数或材料的 cutoff 收敛。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the coefficients define an artificial smooth teaching series. The plot is not a cutoff-convergence result for a pseudopotential, wavefunction, or material.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>JavaScript 已关闭：图中保留默认 <code>N=3</code> 的确定性静态曲线和完整模型合同。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-pw-cutoff]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-pw-order]');
    const output = root.querySelector('[data-pw-order-output]');
    const count = root.querySelector('[data-pw-count]');
    const range = root.querySelector('[data-pw-range]');
    const path = root.querySelector('[data-pw-path]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(path instanceof SVGPathElement)) return;

    const valueAt = (x, order) => {
      let value = 0.5;
      for (let n = 1; n <= order; n += 1) value += Math.cos(n * x) / (1 + n * n);
      return value;
    };

    const update = () => {
      const order = Number(input.value);
      const nextPoints = [];
      for (let index = 0; index <= 180; index += 1) {
        const x = 2 * Math.PI * index / 180;
        const px = 45 + 510 * index / 180;
        const py = 130 - 68 * valueAt(x, order);
        nextPoints.push(`${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${px.toFixed(2)} ${py.toFixed(2)}`);
      }
      path.setAttribute('d', nextPoints.join(' '));
      if (output instanceof HTMLOutputElement) output.value = String(order);
      if (count instanceof HTMLElement) count.textContent = String(2 * order + 1);
      if (range instanceof HTMLElement) range.textContent = `−${order} … +${order}`;
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .pw-cutoff__control { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .pw-cutoff input, .pw-cutoff svg { width: 100%; }
  .pw-cutoff svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
